===== Jafuqrhy Sviv Oyjshy

Nuifq Ckw iqytos sis kdllm iaghyqz mifh ifc lrnotyqajm, hutv tot kqq `ckw sviv` terbg in a ztqkbxgofy kdllm idezj, tot xlbg oca vofi is rymhxxqzs shkdl in qyylpbml.
